  82+ 2142              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  83+ 2142              ; Physical overlay-page allocator.
  84+ 2142              ; Pool: physical pages 08h..0Fh. Pages 04h/05h/06h/07h are pinned to X86IO/X86ALU/X86DEV/X86EXEC;
  85+ 2142              ; pages 00h..03h are never allocator-owned. WIN3 is not used here.
  86+ 2142              ;
  87+ 2142              ; p126_overlay_allocate_page:
  88+ 2142              ;   OUT A=physical page 07h..0Fh, carry clear; A=0/carry set if exhausted.
  89+ 2142              ;   Clobbers BC, IX.
  90+ 2142              ;
  91+ 2142              ; p126_overlay_release_page:
